.Dd June 14, 2026
.Dt MBT_LSD 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_lsd_init ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_recv ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_announce ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_announce_multi ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_frame_parse ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_freep ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_frame_freep ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_frame_info_freep
.Nd Local Service Discovery (LSD) implementation for BitTorrent.
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/lsd.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_lsd_init "struct mbt_lsd **out" "int setfl"
.Ft "struct mbt_lsd *"
.Fn mbt_lsd_recv "struct mbt_lsd *lsd" "struct mbt_lsd_frame **out"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_lsd_announce "struct mbt_lsd *lsd" "const char *infohash_hex" "uint16_t port"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_lsd_announce_multi "struct mbt_lsd *lsd" "const char **hashes" "int count" "uint16_t port"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_lsd_frame_parse "struct mbt_lsd_frame *frame" "struct mbt_lsd_frame_info **out"
.Ft void
.Fn mbt_lsd_freep "struct mbt_lsd **v"
.Ft void
.Fn mbt_lsd_frame_freep "struct mbt_lsd_frame **v"
.Ft void
.Fn mbt_lsd_frame_info_freep "struct mbt_lsd_frame_info **v"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm mbt_lsd
module provides tools for implementing Local Service Discovery (LSD) in BitTorrent, facilitating peer discovery within a local network via IPv4 and IPv6 multicast.
.Sh FUNCTIONS
The following functions manage LSD operations:
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_lsd_init
Initializes a new LSD instance on the specified socket options.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_lsd_recv
Receives and returns a new LSD frame from the socket.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_lsd_announce
Announces an infohash on the local network using multicast.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_lsd_announce_multi
Announces multiple infohashes in one multicast packet.
The packet holds as many of the first
.Fa count
hashes as fit in
.Dv MBT_LSD_MAX_PACKET
bytes, 1400 by BEP 14.
Returns the number of hashes sent, 0 when
.Fa count
is 0, or a negative errno.
To announce all hashes, call again with the rest.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_lsd_frame_parse
Parses a raw LSD frame into an information structure containing the peer address and discovered infohashes.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_lsd_freep ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_frame_freep ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_frame_info_freep
Free the allocated LSD structures and their contents.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt 3
